// Popular in Atlanta (pictures 253 A + 256 A + 257 + 258, Loudjier Nov 17, 2026: "A is my favorite").
// A spotlight stage: #1 big in a soft light on a glowing ring, #2 and #3 waiting at the sides.
// The light follows the shopper's ZIP: Night after sunset, Sunny on sunny days, soft gray with rain or
// clouds otherwise (live weather from the National Weather Service). Motion off = everything still.
