// Trouble codes from a code reader (Loudjier, Nov 12, 2026: his photo of a reader showing P2135 got no help,
// because photos can't be read without the AI). Typing the code now gives its standard meaning (the SAE J2012
// generic definition, the same text a code reader shows) in plain words, how soon to get it checked, and the
// usual next step. Maker-specific codes (P1xxx, B, C, U…) get the general "what the letters mean" answer.
// Never a diagnosis: the same code can have several causes, so a shop confirms it.

export type CodeInfo = { code: string; meaning: string; plain: string; soon: 'today' | 'soon' };

